            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hey @georgeguimaraes , maybe this solution makes your life a little easier\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/discussions/255#discussioncomment-9686309\r\n\r\n```\r\n        ['`'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '``', neigh_pattern = '[^\\\\`].', register = { cr = false } },\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis would avoid the _fourth_ backtick",
