        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> @Susensio Love that solution, allows for pair, but not 4th backtick when doing triples. Thanks for sharing! I think this could be useful in default config to. What you think @echasnovski? 🙏\r\n\r\nI don't think it is that useful as default, as it makes typing **6** backticks (which are needed to designate a codeblock) less comfortable. The fact that it can be configured that way should be enough.",
            "created_at": "2024-10-06T10:45:54Z",
