        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hey thanks for the reply @echasnovski! That's fair!\r\n\r\nThe thing I'm finding is that without that config, it doesn't complete the final three ticks, it only complete one fourth tick, if that makes sense. This is with standard markdown treesitter parser that ships with the official nvim-treesitter repo. Is this how it behaves for you?\r\n\r\n![CleanShot 2024-10-08 at 00 16 49](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d0027b2-2a93-4908-8625-81dae2ddbd40)",
            "created_at": "2024-10-08T04:19:59Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/31#issuecomment-2398794850",
            "id": 2398794850,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/31",
            "minimized": null,
            "node_id": "IC_kwDOFoksYM6O-rRi",
